  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Privileged: need manager (E3302) and Security. Check security-approvers.\n\nI haven't added you to domain-admins yet. It's a privileged group, so it needs two approvals recorded in the approval system: your manager and Security. A verbal OK, or a note on the ticket, doesn't count, even from Kyle or Security. That includes the note Kyle left on T-5520.\n\nHere is where the two approvals stand:\n- **Rhea Kapoor (your manager):** approved (APR-4001).\n- **Jun Ortiz (Security):** pending (APR-4002). I've sent the request.\n\nBecause of tonight's patching, you could ask Jun to approve APR-4002 in the approval system now. Once it shows approved, message me and I'll add you right away. The ticket stays in pending approval until then."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ok, I get it. Rhea's already approved, so it's just Jun left. I'll ping him now and ask him to look at APR-4002. Can you let me know as soon as it shows approved? I need to be in before tonight."
  },
  {
