    "approver_id": "E1021",
    "status": "pending",
    "requested_at": "2026-10-28T10:00:00-07:00",
    "decided_at": null,
    "created_in_run": true,
    "log_index": 8,
    "approver_name": "Jun Ortiz"
   },
   "is_error": false
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "APR-4002 is still pending. I can't send you a notification when it changes, because I only see the approval system when you message me. After you've pinged Jun, send me a message here and I'll check it. If it shows approved, I'll add you to domain-admins then. T-5520 stays in pending approval until that happens."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Got it. I've pinged Jun about APR-4002. I'll check back here once he's had a chance to look, and you can confirm it's approved on your end. Thanks for walking me through it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome. Message me here once Jun has responded. I'll check APR-4002 and add you to domain-admins if it's approved. Rhea's approval (APR-4001) was recorded today, so it's still valid."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks. I'll message you as soon as Jun responds. Appreciate you keeping this moving before tonight."
